eum, take on extra quests, hunt Runes, or gamble your gold away at the bazaar. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay frequently swaps between linear and open-ended sections—keeping the chapters fresh and varied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017620/extras/9c46c2fc313a65cbe9a171489bca614b.poster.avif?t=1770659553\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017620/extras/9c46c2fc313a65cbe9a171489bca614b.webm?t=1770659553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017620/extras/9c46c2fc313a65cbe9a171489bca614b.mp4?t=1770659553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Johan, an introverted young man from the countryside, finds himself thrown into a conflict beyond his comprehension. The Aeons—-an enigmatic &amp; cultish militia—move ever closer to his isolated home on Veritas Mountain. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now faced with a threat to his once-elysian lifestyle, Johan decides on the role he is destined to play in their escalating conflict. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At his side are <strong>Aiden</strong>, the mysterious son of an exiled warrior, who has trained since childhood in the mystic arts; and <strong>Crysta</strong>, a runaway noblewoman intent on ending the war before it reaches her family..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through his coming-of-age journey, Johan confronts the ghosts of his family trauma, his passions and sensuality, and ultimately his own inner demons.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017620/extras/fb25a750e4cf672189a365588a375067.avif?t=1770659553\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p>",
      "short_description": "Beloved Rapture is an indie jRPG inspired by the classics. Explore beautiful landscapes, fight in turn-based battles, and uncover many secrets. This mid-length adventure balances both an intimate coming of age story, and larger threats looming over the troubled kingdom.",
      "supported_languages": "English",
      "reviews": "“A traditional style turn based RPG that offers a very classic experience. It has some important pinches of brilliance that make it rather remarkable.”<br>FromTheVoid Games<br><br>“If you're an old-school gamer like me, then honestly drop everything and just get this game because you will not be disappointed! But even if you're more of a new-school gamer this has everything that you want in a fun filled, bite-sized adventure.”<br>DavidVinc<br><br>“I really feel like I've been along for the ride with these wonderful characters (I've felt their pain and torment, their humor and wit, their love and desires, etc.). I have played countless RPGs over the years and actual storytelling of late seems secondary and slips my mind weeks after playing most games. It's one thing to develop a visually stunning game with fun combat, but to weave a magnificent story that will stay with the player for years, that is truly special.”<br>Pixel Pegasus<br>",
